,\"text\":\"No. While a marketing background helps, PPC is a skill-based career. Many successful PPC experts come from completely different fields and learned everything through courses and practice.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801116507\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801116507\",\"name\":\"2. How long does it take to become job-ready in PPC?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most beginners can reach a job-ready level in three to six months with consistent practice, though becoming truly skilled often takes a year or more of real campaign experience.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801133123\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801133123\",\"name\":\"3. Which platform should I learn first, Google Ads or Meta Ads?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start with Google Ads. It covers the core concepts of auctions, bidding, and Quality Score that apply across\u00a0almost every\u00a0other ad platform.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801163350\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-ppc-expert\/#faq-question-1784801163350\",\"name\":\"4. Is PPC a good career\u00a0option\u00a0in the long run?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes.\u00a0As long as\u00a0businesses want visibility online, they will need people who can manage ad budgets effectively. This makes PPC a stable and growin